GPU Capacity Finder includes the following third-party material.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Natural Earth
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data set: Natural Earth 1:110m physical vectors, "land" polygons (ne_110m_land),
          version 5.2.0-pre (master branch of natural-earth-vector on the retrieval date)
Source:   https://www.naturalearthdata.com/
          (retrieved as GeoJSON from
          https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector/master/geojson/ne_110m_land.geojson)
Retrieved: 2026-11-11
Used in:  web/world.json (the land outline behind the Region map). The polygons
          were projected to x = (longitude + 180) * 2, y = (90 - latitude) * 2,
          rounded to one decimal, and joined into one SVG path. Polygons that lie
          entirely south of latitude 60 S (Antarctica) were left out.

License:  Natural Earth data is in the public domain. Per the Natural Earth terms
          of use (https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/), no
          permission is needed to use it, and no attribution is required.
